rofd (0.3.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Add bounded, cached page text semantics together with C APIs for
    text extraction, layout, search, and selection.

 -- HualetWang <hualet@hualet.org>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 20:31:20 +0800

rofd (0.2.3-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * New OFD rendering features: text clip areas (Clip/Text), structured
    CGTransform glyph matrices, ApplicationBox/ContentBox/BleedBox page
    areas, multiple DocBody historical version support, image borders/
    masks/substitution, page annotations, composite vector graphics,
    Gray/CMYK colour spaces, JBIG2 decoding, and unknown graphic unit
    lenient skipping.  Bumps rofd-core to 0.2.1 and rofd-render to 0.1.1.

 -- HualetWang <hualet@hualet.org>  Thu, 10 Sep 2026 00:00:00 +0800

rofd (0.2.2-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Stabilize CI rendering comparisons: install the controlled Noto
    fonts in the deepin build container and relax the threshold for
    fixtures that rely on non-embedded system fallback fonts.

 -- HualetWang <hualet@hualet.org>  Wed, 09 Sep 2026 13:25:31 +0800

